  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Darfur: Triangle of Peace and Coexistence: Building the social cohesion of communities receiving youth returnees as a bridge to peaceful and effective reintegration.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a reliable UN Country Team model for peace-building at community level, working with all stakeholders to undertake inclusive and participatory conflict resolution and development planning processes to establish a comprehensive set of community-owned Locality Action Plans to consolidate the peace, renew the social contract, and unlock durable solutions for IDPs and refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
